  "bodyHash": "3740b670587dcbc3",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EH9RXWf.png\" alt=\"标题\"></p>\n<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/NotToBlame/Mini-Me-Totem\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-0C0D0F?logo=github&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fNotToBlame\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--Fi-0C0D0F?logo=kofi&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://twitch.tv/NotToBlame\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Twitch-0C0D0F?logo=twitch&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2kprrpbDfK\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-0C0D0F?logo=discord&style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n<p><strong>🧸 Mini-Me Totem</strong> 是一个轻量级的资源包，它将“不死图腾”替换为你 Minecraft 皮肤的小 Q 版形象。</p>\n<h2>功能特点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用你自己的皮肤作为图腾模型  </li>\n<li>设置简单——只需替换一个文件  </li>\n<li>非常适合内容创作者或个性化定制  </li>\n<li>与其他资源包兼容且性能友好</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>安装说明</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>下载你的 Minecraft 皮肤（例如，从 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnamemc.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NameMC</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftskins.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MinecraftSkins</a> 下载）。</li>\n<li>替换以下路径中的文件：<ul>\n<li><code>assets/minecraft/textures/item/totem_of_undying.png</code>（适用于 1.13 及以上版本）</li>\n<li>或 <code>assets/minecraft/textures/item/totem.png</code>（适用于 1.13 以下版本）</li></ul></li>\n<li>保存并在 Minecraft 中加载该资源包。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>预览</h2>\n<p>\n  <strong>默认皮肤</strong><br>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cGJf4uI.png\" width=\"500\">\n</p>\n<p>\n  <strong>自定义皮肤</strong><br>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DqLfoIE.png\" width=\"500\">\n</p>\n<h2>支持</h2>\n<p>如需帮助或提交错误报告，请在 <a href=\"https://github.com/NotToBlame/mini-me-totem/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上创建 Issue，或加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2kprrpbDfK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>。</p>",
